line	
line	<col=000080>Exit Tenzing's house through the north door and then climb over the <col=800000>stile</col>. Take the path north and around to the east (past the second mountain goat) until the message "I think this is far enough" appears in the chat box (NOT the Death Plateau warning, this is another message; you can ignore the warning, since the trolls only attack you on the main path).</col>
